#   biHeight <= 100), and in the AcSswImgListProc range the image drawer 0x4858056C
#   (a BMP, else a JPEG), the file loader 0x485812EA (0: error -0x6D), the size
#   check 0x4858163F (after GetJpegSize finds no size; 0: it returns 0, the value
